            "created_at": "2025-08-06T14:29:12.438839+00:00",
            "notes": "While this build will focus on anti'ing the enemy team, start off the game with targeting allies and choosing  [Home Remedy](item_de68ba66-26d5-4136-a0c1-6396d3f1b0c7)! A super underrated power imo, that extra bit of overhealth can come in super clutch. Also adds a lot of survivability when used on yourself.\n\nFor the first round, just focus on survivability items, such as  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6). You can be pretty flexible with the green items that you chose, but choosing the basic  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) and  [Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7) are always safe picks.",
