            "notes": "[Target Tracker](item_450e11f9-34b6-40c6-b810-0a9ad6c7a093) synergizes really well with any grenade-based build. It's a relatively cheap item as well so a great pick for early game!\n\nKeeping  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) and buying [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) is essentially a more cost-efficient Nano Cola with the added effect of 5% CD reduction so go ahead and chose this combo as well.",
