            "notes": "Pick  [Venomous](item_594b0c79-5440-475c-b64c-c0295c46d735) as your second power and now your build can start coming into effect!\n\nYour main item here should be  [Grenadius Pin](item_acd985cf-2e74-4e18-8fad-cdaa0837fc78); not only does this add extra AP, having that increased grenade radius makes it a lot easier to hit numerous targets at once.\n\nIf you're short on cash you can swap out Multi-tool for either  [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) or a few green items that build on AP, lifesteal or just bulk up and add some armour!",
