            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-06T14:29:12.438839+00:00",
            "notes": "At this point in the game you want to be SPAMMING those grenades, so it's very important to choose  [Cluster Core](item_c63cd7ba-b71c-4503-bdb6-4ef0b0a4bdbb). Ana's grenades have a CD of 13 seconds, so even hitting THREE people with your grenades will bring that cooldown to almost HALF of what it normally is. A bonus effect - this is a HUGE lifesteal effect. Don't be afraid to \"waste\" your grenades; just throw them at lots of people and the CD will come back in no time.\n\nIf you're short on cash no worries; Multi-tool is great but you can just sell it and use  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) instead; has the exact same effect just without the 5% CD.",
