            "notes": "Now you can pick  [Time Out](item_34fc2f6c-ecd9-489e-98ca-d08f3eb2fac1) as your third power. Hitting multiple targets with that speed reduction can be HUGE. \n\nI've played around with this build a lot and  [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) is SO deadly with this build. You should constantly be healing your teammates (usually unscoped spams) so that 5 stack of AP from Superflexor will be punishing AF for those who suffer from your grenades!\n\nOnce again if you are short on cash, you can discard Multi-tool and/or Power Playbook.",
