            "notes": "For the final round your last power can be pretty flexible! I like to use but  [No Scope Needed](item_823db5eb-5a24-4bac-b850-0aa34e76b4f6) for quick heals (the attack power also pairs well with  [Target Tracker](item_450e11f9-34b6-40c6-b810-0a9ad6c7a093)) but [Our Turn](item_6e0fdb41-c00f-41d9-8ec2-1246b34a539a) is also a great option. Chose whichever you wish!\n\nThe build is pretty much maxed out right now; sell  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) and trade it out for  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) to get 10% more AP and 5% more CD cooldown.",
